BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gianmarco Soresi: Drama King
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260620T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260620T210000
UID:bat-202606201900-gianmarco-soresi-drama-king@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Gianmarco Soresi is a New York–based stand-up comedian\, 
 actor\, and creator known for his sharp societal observations and spry\, e
 nergetic stage presence. He effortlessly commands a room with an animated 
 performance style that blends upbeat candor with darker comedic beats\, cr
 eating stand-up that is both intelligent and emotionally resonant. Gianmar
 co’s work has earned critical acclaim from The New York Times\, NPR\, Es
 quire\, The Atlantic\, BuzzFeed\, ABC News\, Billboard\, and many others.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/129480
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Another Revolution
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260620T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260620T213000
UID:bat-202606201930-another-revolution@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Kat and Henry\, two graduate students from opposing scienti
 fic disciplines\, are forced to share a lab at Columbia University in 1968
 . Amidst interpersonal differences\, a campus devolving into political cha
 os\, and the uncertainty and turmoil of the outside world\, they each disc
 over what it’s like to be thrown into someone else’s orbit.
LOCATION:Constellation Playhouse
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/another-revolution/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
